author=yafi
description=FAST_CHARGING_PLUS v1.0 oleh yafi. Modul fast charging dioptimalkan khusus Poco F4 (munch / SM8250) Evolution X. Tanpa Game Bypass Mode dan tanpa inactive charging - baterai tetap diisi saat main game. Screen-on throttle bypass, unlock system_temp_level, dual charge pump 67W, live Watt indicator di notifikasi.
